      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Universal Basic Income (UBI) is the only viable solution to prevent societal collapse due to AI-driven job automation because it directly addresses the growing income inequality and job displacement. As AI takes over middle-class jobs, millions will lose their primary source of income, leading to increased poverty and social unrest. UBI ensures a safety net for all citizens, providing them with the financial stability needed to adapt to the changing job market. It also fosters innovation and entrepreneurship, as people will have the freedom to pursue their passions without the fear of financial ruin. Without UBI, we risk creating a society where the rich get richer while the middle class and poor struggle to survive, leading to increased crime rates, mental health issues, and overall societal instability. UBI is not just a safety net; it's a necessary step towards a more equitable and prosperous future.",
